      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$16\cosh^{2}\theta - 16$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$- ( x + 1 ) 2 + 5 - ( x + 1 ) 2 + 5$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>Integrate using the method of trigonometric substitution. Express the final answer in terms of the variable.</paragraph>
